[{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0812","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0812.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-21350","title":"Microsoft Windows Kerberos 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Windows Kerberos 认证协议存在输入验证不当漏洞（CWE-20），未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向目标域控制器发送特制的 Kerberos 认证请求触发该漏洞，导致目标系统的 Kerberos 服务崩溃或停止响应，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞攻击复杂度较高（AC:H），无需用户交互即可远程利用，影响 Windows Server 系列操作系统。Microsoft 已在 2025 年 2 月安全更新（KB5051974）中修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.9,"aliases":["CVE-2025-21350"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-02-11T18:15:33Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:43:10Z","remediation":"建议立即安装 Microsoft 2025 年 2 月安全更新 KB5051974，该更新修复了 Windows Kerberos 中的输入验证缺陷，防止未经认证的远程攻击者通过特制 Kerberos 请求触发服务拒绝。可通过 Windows Update 自动更新或访问 Microsoft 更新目录手动下载安装。如无法立即打补丁，可在防火墙层面限制对域控制器 88/TCP 和 88/UDP 端口的非信任来源访问作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2025-21350","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a0edea60322bafbed67887cf7a4d97a55df8a9fa/cves/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21350.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/66d1812e8a3da670e7f0e03b721b33c3bf9d2035/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21350.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/e6d30197c1ae0e0b416414f6f0ed16544575a73f/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-21350.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/e6d30197c1ae0e0b416414f6f0ed16544575a73f/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-21350.json","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/63ad67a97b34adc6ff5f668eaf85b5dbf28137e8/2025/CVE-2025-21350/README.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-21350.json","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/63ad67a97b34adc6ff5f668eaf85b5dbf28137e8/2025/CVE-2025-21350/poc.py","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2025-21350.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/17e962b373a9dbef6aa7b426a0062ee15f6ee207/2025/CVE-2025-21350.json","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2025-21350"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0812.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0810","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0810.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-21349","title":"Microsoft Windows 远程桌面配置服务篡改漏洞","description":"Windows 远程桌面配置服务存在身份验证不当漏洞（CWE-287），攻击者可通过诱导已登录用户访问恶意构造的远程桌面服务器，在用户交互条件下利用该漏洞篡改远程桌面配置服务。成功利用此漏洞可导致目标系统的机密性和完整性受到高等级破坏，但攻击复杂度较高且需要用户交互。Microsoft 已在 2025 年 2 月安全更新（5051974）中修复此漏洞，影响 Windows 10/11 及 Windows Server 多个版本。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.8,"aliases":["CVE-2025-21349"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-02-11T18:15:33Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:43:09Z","remediation":"建议立即安装 Microsoft 2025 年 2 月安全更新 (KB5051974)。各受影响版本的最低修复版本号：Windows 10 1507 升级到 10.0.10240.20915，Windows 10 1607 升级到 10.0.14393.7785，Windows 10 1809/Server 2019 升级到 10.0.17763.6893，Windows 10 21H2 升级到 10.0.19044.5487，Windows 10 22H2 升级到 10.0.19045.5487，Windows 11 22H2 升级到 10.0.22621.4890，Windows 11 23H2 升级到 10.0.22631.4890，Windows 11 24H2/Server 2025 升级到 10.0.26100.3194，Server 2022 升级到 10.0.20348.3207，Server 2022 23H2 升级到 10.0.25398.1425。如无法立即打补丁，可通过组策略限制非管理员用户对远程桌面配置服务 (Termsrv.dll) 的访问权限作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2025-21349","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a0edea60322bafbed67887cf7a4d97a55df8a9fa/cves/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21349.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/66d1812e8a3da670e7f0e03b721b33c3bf9d2035/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21349.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/e6d30197c1ae0e0b416414f6f0ed16544575a73f/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-21349.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/e6d30197c1ae0e0b416414f6f0ed16544575a73f/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-21349.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-21349.json","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/63ad67a97b34adc6ff5f668eaf85b5dbf28137e8/2025/CVE-2025-21349/README.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2025-21349.json","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/63ad67a97b34adc6ff5f668eaf85b5dbf28137e8/2025/CVE-2025-21349/poc.py","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/8eb5179bc94e368fed99f8f208b080aa4b8a56b8/2025/CVE-2025-21349.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2025/CVE-2025-213xx/CVE-2025-21349.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0810.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0795","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0795.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-21337","title":"Microsoft Windows NTFS 特权提升漏洞","description":"Windows NTFS 文件系统存在访问控制不当漏洞（CWE-284），低权限本地攻击者可利用该漏洞读取本应受保护的文件内容，导致机密信息泄露。攻击者需具备本地系统访问权限及低权限用户身份，无需用户交互即可触发。该漏洞影响 Windows 10/11 多个版本及 Windows Server 2008/2012/2016/2019/2022/2025 等版本，CVSS 评分 3.3，危害等级低。Microsoft 已在 2025 年 2 月安全更新（KB5051974）中修复此漏洞。","severity":"LOW","score":3.3,"aliases":["CVE-2025-21337"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-02-11T18:15:33Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:43:08Z","remediation":"建议立即安装 Microsoft 2025 年 2 月安全更新 (KB5051974)，可通过 Windows Update 自动获取或从 Microsoft Update Catalog 手动下载。受影响版本包括 Windows 10/11 及 Windows Server 多版本，更新后对应版本号分别为：Win10 1507≥10.0.10240.20915、Win10 1607≥10.0.14393.7785、Win10 1809/Server 2019≥10.0.17763.6893、Win10 21H2≥10.0.19044.5487、Win10 22H2≥10.0.19045.5487、Win11 22H2≥10.0.22621.4890、Win11 23H2≥10.0.22631.4890、Win11 24H2/Server 2025≥10.0.26100.3194、Server 2016≥10.0.14393.7785、Server 2022≥10.0.20348.3207、Server 2022 23H2≥10.0.25398.1425。如无法立即打补丁，建议限制本地用户对 NTFS 卷的物理访问权限作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2025-21337","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a31aa101497b2d23391e84ef31f75e6600381dae/cves/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21337.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/bbff37eeafd64310b94d439a5f7493406fcdc115/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21337.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/be7c9eef0523e112dce5fde0006bf85d14a40618/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-21337.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/be7c9eef0523e112dce5fde0006bf85d14a40618/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-21337.json","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/2264199c0bc0c33bf5461ebe5626e7d18358baaf/2025/CVE-2025-21337/README.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-21337.json","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/2264199c0bc0c33bf5461ebe5626e7d18358baaf/2025/CVE-2025-21337/poc.py","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2025-21337.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/3355d48a7d0ca0d3b4124274995f7205f0bb89f2/2025/CVE-2025-21337.json","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2025-21337"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0795.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0781","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0781.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-21322","title":"Microsoft PC Manager 特权提升漏洞","description":"Microsoft PC Manager 存在 Improper Link Resolution Before File Access（CWE-59）漏洞，即符号链接跟踪漏洞。本地攻击者可在低权限条件下利用该漏洞，通过创建恶意的符号链接指向系统敏感文件，诱使 PC Manager 以高权限执行文件操作，从而将权限提升至 SYSTEM。成功利用后攻击者可完全控制受影响系统，包括安装程序、查看/更改/删除数据或创建新账户。Microsoft 已在 2025 年 2 月安全更新中修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2025-21322"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-02-11T18:15:33Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:43:05Z","remediation":"建议立即通过 Microsoft Store 将 Microsoft PC Manager 更新至最新版本（2025 年 2 月安全更新已修复此漏洞）。打开 Microsoft Store → 库 → 获取更新，或开启自动更新以确保及时安装。由于该漏洞为本地提权（需低权限用户登录后触发），如无法立即更新，应限制非管理员用户的本地登录权限，并监控异常的文件链接创建行为作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2025-21322","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/27584df20575115093a915d82c76b5107dd9d51e/cves/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21322.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/0fed28f73afbb5eb38c05b167f63ae6a3a91eb60/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21322.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c31c0a9b9af147bd58078ebf7769418f19d3f2e1/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-21322.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c31c0a9b9af147bd58078ebf7769418f19d3f2e1/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-21322.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-21322.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2025-21322.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/b6c80ad7b47e52f64ae2ee2b20e56d7eaaaa57fe/CVE-2025/CVE-2025-213xx/CVE-2025-21322.json","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/6ec632010d315a88d01b5e16f880583e130a89b3/2025/CVE-2025-21322/README.md","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/c6500283f68defe11c86dcd41d1529288a6fc9b1/2025/CVE-2025-21322.json","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/6ec632010d315a88d01b5e16f880583e130a89b3/2025/CVE-2025-21322/poc.py"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0781.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0718","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0718.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-21259","title":"Microsoft Outlook 欺骗漏洞","description":"Microsoft Outlook 存在欺骗漏洞，攻击者可利用邮件处理逻辑缺陷伪造发件人身份或邮件元数据，诱导受害者信任恶意邮件内容。该漏洞影响多个 Outlook 版本（含 Office 365、Outlook 2016/2019/2021 等），CVSS 5.3 中危评分。攻击条件：仅需网络访问权限，无需身份认证或用户交互即可发送特制邮件触发。利用方式：攻击者构造伪造邮件头或利用解析不一致，使 Outlook 显示虚假发件人地址、域名或安全指示器，配合社会工程学实施钓鱼、业务邮件欺诈（BEC）或恶意软件分发。Microsoft 已于 2025 年 2 月安全更新中修复此漏洞，建议尽快升级至最新版本。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.3,"aliases":["CVE-2025-21259"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-02-11T18:15:32Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:42:55Z","remediation":"建议立即将 Microsoft Outlook for Android 升级至 4.2501.1 或更高版本，通过 Google Play 商店或 Microsoft 官方渠道获取 2025 年 2 月安全更新。若暂时无法更新，可在邮件客户端启用「仅显示受信任发件人」设置，并在企业层面部署邮件网关规则拦截伪造发件人域名的可疑邮件作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2025-21259","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/73e213348ddf142cab7e77d05861fa314ba8e1d0/cves/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21259.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/bc943eb819a406135c2391ed30d595e2ea60281b/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21259.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/cec9fb1846e25b24020f297f65ec2360af0f4267/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-21259.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/cec9fb1846e25b24020f297f65ec2360af0f4267/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-21259.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-21259.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2025-21259.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/b5070d3c2d6dc2fda079c163276abcda1c82b124/CVE-2025/CVE-2025-212xx/CVE-2025-21259.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/1a96290b5e035ce53ab9adc58193928385ac790b/2025/CVE-2025-21259.json","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-nvd/blob/7bec7ab13a920b5bdca1b43ac1859f030aec77a0/api/2025/CVE-2025-21259.json","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2025-21259"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0718.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0713","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0713.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-21254","title":"Microsoft Windows Internet Connection Sharing (ICS) 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Windows Internet Connection Sharing (ICS) 存在拒绝服务漏洞，攻击者可通过向目标系统发送特制的相邻网络数据包引发服务崩溃。该漏洞影响 Windows 10/11 及 Windows Server 2019/2022 等版本，可导致系统网络连接功能完全不可用。攻击无需认证且无用户交互，利用路径为构造恶意邻近网络流量。攻击者可远程触发此漏洞，导致系统响应停滞，服务不可用。该漏洞 CVSS 评分 6.5，危害等级中等，由微软安全团队确认。微软已发布安全更新 MS5051974 修复此漏洞，建议用户及时更新补丁以防止服务中断影响网络连接。确保防火墙规则和网络监控机制，以检测和阻止此类恶意流量。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.5,"aliases":["CVE-2025-21254"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-02-11T18:15:32Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:42:54Z","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 2024 年 8 月安全更新（KB5051974），升级到 Windows 10 版本 22H2（19045.5487）及以上版本或 Windows 11 版本 22H2（22621.4890）及以上版本。如无法立即更新，可临时禁用受影响的 Internet Connection Sharing (ICS) 服务或在防火墙中限制对 ICS 端口的访问。立即访问 Microsoft 官方安全更新指南获取完整补丁信息：https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2025-21254。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2025-21254","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0661b1b09ba7a2e855981f4a1781f3b8de7cf562/cves/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21254.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/0812ebe932b97710173c59d3d74959fb420956eb/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21254.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/8a257d250bdb59b542a188d62ddae45e6eb5d3f2/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-21254.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/8a257d250bdb59b542a188d62ddae45e6eb5d3f2/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-21254.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-21254.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2025-21254.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/7634b452e97baac8445d2f4e188785cc5c593d5a/2025/CVE-2025-21254.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/b5070d3c2d6dc2fda079c163276abcda1c82b124/CVE-2025/CVE-2025-212xx/CVE-2025-21254.json","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2025-21254","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21254.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0713.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0675","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0675.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-21216","title":"Microsoft Windows Internet Connection Sharing (ICS) 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Windows Internet Connection Sharing (ICS) 组件存在越界读取漏洞，CVSS 评分 6.5，危害等级中危。该漏洞源于 ICS 服务在处理特制网络数据包时未正确验证输入边界，导致越界内存读取。位于同一相邻网络的未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向目标系统发送特制的网络数据包触发该漏洞，导致 ICS 服务崩溃并拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Windows 10、Windows 11 及 Windows Server 多个版本，Microsoft 已在 2025 年 2 月安全更新中修复。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.5,"aliases":["CVE-2025-21216"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-02-11T18:15:32Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:42:47Z","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 2025 年 2 月安全更新 KB5051974（OS Builds 19044.5487 / 19045.5487），可通过 Windows Update 自动获取或从 Microsoft 更新目录手动下载。该更新修复了 Windows 10 21H2 和 22H2 中 Internet 连接共享 (ICS) 组件的拒绝服务漏洞。如无法立即打补丁，可在网络层面限制对 ICS 服务的邻接网络访问，或禁用 Internet 连接共享功能作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2025-21216","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/57d47b7d3f36bb14623bb27ddb073baead1c6714/cves/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21216.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/1fe56a0dafbbcb548bdcdd4fc990cca72ac81c28/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21216.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/37abbcb2a8225ed14d2b9dfffb1ad41b15cc2cc8/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-21216.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/37abbcb2a8225ed14d2b9dfffb1a