-2025-21212.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/1fe56a0dafbbcb548bdcdd4fc990cca72ac81c28/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21212.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/37abbcb2a8225ed14d2b9dfffb1ad41b15cc2cc8/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-21212.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/37abbcb2a8225ed14d2b9dfffb1ad41b15cc2cc8/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-21212.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-21212.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2025-21212.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/e615d840f21a506ab4861678584a0f621d55a0d3/2025/CVE-2025-21212.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/0d2adc4a9428696b559622523817d9cdfdad97f0/CVE-2025/CVE-2025-212xx/CVE-2025-21212.json","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2025-21212","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21212.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0671.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0668","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0668.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-21208","title":"Windows 路由和远程访问服务 (RRAS) 远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Windows 路由和远程访问服务（RRAS）存在堆缓冲区溢出漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向目标系统发送特制的 RRAS 请求触发该漏洞，成功利用可在目标系统上以系统权限执行任意代码。该漏洞影响多个 Windows Server 版本，攻击需要用户交互（如点击恶意链接），CVSS 评分 8.8，危害等级高危。Microsoft 已在 2025 年 2 月安全更新中修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.8,"aliases":["CVE-2025-21208"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-02-11T18:15:31Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:42:46Z","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 2025 年 2 月安全更新 (KB5051987 或 KB5052105/KB5052072)，可通过 Windows Update 自动获取。如无法立即打补丁，可在服务管理控制台 (services.msc) 中禁用 Routing and Remote Access 服务，或在防火墙层面限制对 RRAS 服务端口 (1723/PPTP、500/IKE、4500/IPsec) 的入站访问作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2025-21208","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/57d47b7d3f36bb14623bb27ddb073baead1c6714/cves/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21208.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/1fe56a0dafbbcb548bdcdd4fc990cca72ac81c28/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21208.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/37abbcb2a8225ed14d2b9dfffb1ad41b15cc2cc8/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-21208.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/37abbcb2a8225ed14d2b9dfffb1ad41b15cc2cc8/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-21208.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-21208.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2025-21208.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/27523a604e3f97178dcb3b94e85e828af75534c5/2025/CVE-2025-21208.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/0d2adc4a9428696b559622523817d9cdfdad97f0/CVE-2025/CVE-2025-212xx/CVE-2025-21208.json","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2025-21208","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-nvd/blob/ef57640f19da1737a8612e28839821eee8a753b5/api/2025/CVE-2025-21208.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0668.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0666","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0666.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-21206","title":"Microsoft Visual Studio Installer 特权提升漏洞","description":"Visual Studio Installer 存在不受控制的搜索路径元素漏洞（CWE-427），由于安装程序在加载动态链接库时未正确限制搜索路径，本地低权限攻击者可通过诱使用户执行特定操作（如打开恶意项目文件），将恶意 DLL 放置在特定目录中触发加载，从而以高权限执行任意代码，实现权限提升。该漏洞影响 Visual Studio 相关安装组件，CVSS 评分 7.3，危害等级高。Microsoft 已在 2025 年 2 月安全更新中修复。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.3,"aliases":["CVE-2025-21206"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-02-11T18:15:31Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:42:46Z","remediation":"建议立即更新 Visual Studio Installer 至修复版本：Visual Studio 2017 升级至 15.9.70 及以上、Visual Studio 2019 升级至 16.11.44 及以上、Visual Studio 2022 v17.8 升级至 17.8.18 及以上、v17.10 升级至 17.10.11 及以上、v17.12 升级至 17.12.5 及以上。通过 Visual Studio 菜单\"帮助→检查更新\"或从 visualstudio.microsoft.com/downloads 下载最新安装程序。该漏洞为安装程序组件中的不受控搜索路径元素（CWE-427），低权限用户可能通过劫持 DLL 加载路径实现权限提升，无法立即更新的环境下应限制非授权用户对系统的本地交互访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2025-21206","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/57d47b7d3f36bb14623bb27ddb073baead1c6714/cves/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21206.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/1fe56a0dafbbcb548bdcdd4fc990cca72ac81c28/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21206.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/37abbcb2a8225ed14d2b9dfffb1ad41b15cc2cc8/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-21206.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/37abbcb2a8225ed14d2b9dfffb1ad41b15cc2cc8/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-21206.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-21206.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2025-21206.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/0d2adc4a9428696b559622523817d9cdfdad97f0/CVE-2025/CVE-2025-212xx/CVE-2025-21206.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/27523a604e3f97178dcb3b94e85e828af75534c5/2025/CVE-2025-21206.json","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-nvd/blob/ef57640f19da1737a8612e28839821eee8a753b5/api/2025/CVE-2025-21206.json","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/mitre/CVE-2025-21206"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0666.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0661","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0661.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-21201","title":"Microsoft Windows Telephony Server 远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Windows Telephony Server（电话服务）存在双重释放（Double Free）内存破坏漏洞，CVSS 评分 8.8，危害等级高。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向目标系统发送特制的请求触发该漏洞，成功利用可在目标系统上以 SYSTEM 权限执行任意代码，完全控制受影响系统。攻击需要用户交互（如诱导用户点击恶意链接或打开恶意文件），但无需任何特权。该漏洞影响多个 Windows 版本，Microsoft 已在 2025 年 2 月安全更新（KB5051974）中修复。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.8,"aliases":["CVE-2025-21201"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-02-11T18:15:31Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:42:45Z","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 2025 年 2 月安全更新 KB5051974（Windows 10 22H2 更新至 OS Build 19045.5487，Windows Server 2019 更新至 KB5052000 OS Build 17763.6893），可通过 Windows Update 自动获取或从 Microsoft 更新目录手动下载。如无法立即打补丁，建议在防火墙层面限制对 TAPI 服务（RPC 端口 135/TCP 及动态 RPC 端口范围）的入站访问，并禁用不必要的 Telephony 服务作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2025-21201","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/57d47b7d3f36bb14623bb27ddb073baead1c6714/cves/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21201.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/1fe56a0dafbbcb548bdcdd4fc990cca72ac81c28/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21201.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2d66b7c0b89f8bfe02ef8d342b4bf0a1bab5ffd1/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-21201.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2d66b7c0b89f8bfe02ef8d342b4bf0a1bab5ffd1/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-21201.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-21201.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/0913c49bc4f4fd607e8625f162967246063e1d20/2025/CVE-2025-21201.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/9b1777f43cb72006ac01427b6823146d45a3862a/nvdcve/CVE-2025-21201.json","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2025-21201","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21201.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2025-21201"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0661.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0660","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0660.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-21200","title":"Windows 电话服务远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Windows Telephony Service（电话服务API）存在堆缓冲区溢出漏洞（CWE-122），攻击者可通过向目标系统发送特制请求触发内存损坏，导致远程代码执行。该漏洞影响多个Windows版本，CVSS评分8.8，危害等级高。利用需用户交互（如点击恶意链接），成功后可获取系统控制权。Microsoft已在2025年2月安全更新（KB5051974等）中修复。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.8,"aliases":["CVE-2025-21200"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-02-11T18:15:31Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:42:45Z","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 2025 年 2 月安全更新（KB5051974），适用于受影响版本的 Windows。可通过 Windows Update 自动获取更新，或从 Microsoft 更新目录手动下载安装。如无法立即打补丁，建议禁用 Telephony 服务（TapiSrv）并限制网络侧对 RPC 端口的访问作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2025-21200","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/57d47b7d3f36bb14623bb27ddb073baead1c6714/cves/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21200.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/1fe56a0dafbbcb548bdcdd4fc990cca72ac81c28/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21200.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2d66b7c0b89f8bfe02ef8d342b4bf0a1bab5ffd1/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-21200.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2d66b7c0b89f8bfe02ef8d342b4bf0a1bab5ffd1/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-21200.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-21200.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/0913c49bc4f4fd607e8625f162967246063e1d20/2025/CVE-2025-21200.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/9b1777f43cb72006ac01427b6823146d45a3